  "prefLabel": "Ins 1801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1801.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 420-D wherein the general court has provided for the regulation of continuing care communities (CCCs) in order to protect the citizens of the state, particularly senior citizens.\n\nSource. #4666, eff 8-22-89; ss by #5654, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7014, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 7-1-07\n\nNew. #8991, eff 10-1-07; ss by #10944, eff 10-8-15; ss by #14640, eff 6-27-26, EXPIRES: 6-27-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1800.html"
